Hi geomorph community,

I have a few undergraduates trying to install geomorph onto their Macs (OS Tahoe). However, it turns out there might be a compatibility <https://discussions.apple.com/thread/256157657?sortBy=rank> issue between XQuartz and Tahoe OS. Has anyone figured out how to get XQuartz to work on their Tahoe OS or a way to get 3D figures to display when using rgl/geomorph? Below is the error displayed when loading geomorph.

1: In rgl.init(initValue, onlyNULL) : X11 error: GLXBadContext
2: 'rgl.init' failed, will use the null device

Thanks!

Chris J. Law
